/* ------------------------------------------------------------------ *
 * Table — built from Figma node 42361:4306 (Table / Simple / Comfortable)
 *
 * Filtering follows the MUI X Data Grid filter model (GridFilterModel):
 *   { items: [{ id, field, operator, value }], logicOperator: "and" | "or" }
 * so `filterModel` can be passed straight to <DataGrid filterModel={…} />
 * when this is exported. The UI (filter bar, chips, panel) is NEXT-styled.
 * ------------------------------------------------------------------ */

